to embed the Python code as a JSON string. So we need to write the Python code in a string literal with proper escaping. I'll write the code and then encode.\n\nLet's produce final answer."},"logprobs":null,"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1525,"completion_tokens":1336,"total_tokens":2861,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":1408},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":878},"prompt_cache_hit_tokens":1408,"prompt_cache_miss_tokens":117},"system_fingerprint":"fp_8b330d02d0_prod0820_fp8_kvcache_20260402"}